# Optional. Public Reown / WalletConnect project id (it is not a secret: it ships in every dApp bundle).
# If unset, the project id already used by this site is used.
# Restrict it to your site's domain in https://dashboard.reown.com (Domain allowlist).
VITE_REOWN_PROJECT_ID=
# Never put private API keys, RPC keys with spending power, or any secret in a VITE_* variable:
# everything prefixed VITE_ is embedded in the public JavaScript bundle.
